# Brand assets are used AS SUPPLIED, and their bytes are pinned by sha256 in
# src/lib/design-system/assets/PROVENANCE.json. Git must not rewrite them:
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, which changes the hash on
# Windows and leaves it alone on Linux, so the same commit would pass the audit
# on one machine and fail it on another. -text disables that translation.
*.svg -text
*.png binary
*.ico binary
